This "level-teleport" business has me perplexed as well.  

I have utilized the Teleport Control (ring), with Confusion (potion),     
and Teleportation (scroll) combination.  While this _does_ perform a
level teleport, I can't seem to _control_ the teleportation.  In other
words, I end up at a _random_ level, despite the control the ring is
supposed to provide. 

Also, elsewhere in this notestring, it was mentioned that you should
be able to level-teleport substituting the Teleportation ring for
the teleportation scroll (while still using the confusion potion, and
Teleport Control ring).  This is not so!  While this combination 
