tried this, I was in good stead with my god (recent "offering" of a
chaotic monster corpse resulted in a 4-leaf clover at my feet).

BTW, I'm a neutral wizard with about 80 HP, at dungeon level 10 and
an experience level of 10 (I found a wraith-graveyard!).  Also, the
ring, scroll, and potion were all uncursed (although not blessed).

It is my impression that this level-teleport technique is quite a
simple feat (once you understand the components), and while I feel
